00:34:46.560 --> 00:34:49.280
You get out very seamless
developer experience using

00:34:49.280 --> 00:34:51.324
gcloud, the command line tool.

00:34:51.324 --> 00:34:53.449
And by the way, you can do
all this stuff in the UI

00:34:53.449 --> 00:34:54.900
too, in the user interface.

00:34:54.900 --> 00:34:59.270
We're just using gcloud because
it lends itself well to a demo,

00:34:59.270 --> 00:35:01.880
and we see that pattern
a lot among developers.

00:35:01.880 --> 00:35:06.290
And so to do this,
