00:35:49.683 --> 00:35:50.600
STEWART REICHLING: OK.

00:35:50.600 --> 00:35:53.510
So rather than saying,
hey, region, which region

00:35:53.510 --> 00:35:54.980
would be a region--

00:35:54.980 --> 00:35:57.500
one of the ones supported in
Cloud Run and Google's data

00:35:57.500 --> 00:36:00.380
centers, he's going to say,
hey, this cluster, which he's

00:36:00.380 --> 00:36:03.500
called cloud-run-gke,
